Rule "Move client mail" in work (outlook)

Order: 1
State: on
Conditions (all must match; a list matches when any value does):
  From: client@example.test
  Subject contains: invoice, contract
  Body contains: body
Exceptions (all must match; a list matches when any value does):
  Subject contains: skip
Actions:
  Move to folder: Clients/ACME (id acme-id)
  Copy to folder: Archive (id archive-id)
  Mark as read: yes
  Stop other rules: yes
  Add categories: Review
  Set importance: low
  Forward to: ops@external.test
Fields maildo cannot edit (they stay as they are):
  actions.assignCategories: preserved documented provider field
  actions.copyToFolder: preserved documented provider field
  actions.forwardTo: preserved documented provider field
  actions.markImportance: preserved documented provider field
  actions.providerAction: unknown provider object with 1 field(s)
  conditions.bodyContains: preserved documented provider field
  conditions.providerPredicate: unknown provider array with 1 item(s)
  exceptions.exceptionFuture: unknown provider string
